    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Ben Pisarevsky",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115138301992222275325/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocK_nKJoJJgyMR61buOLAe1opJYUzwFGBiRxNFBS8S1sXlpJTA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 weeks ago",
        "text": "Incredible service, quality and after purchase service.\nChris and his team installed our garage and our wall mounted motor, they did it quickly and professionally. We needed an adjustment a year later and Chris came himself to help adjust the height of the garage.\nThey actually answer the phone and seem to care about their customers! Thank you guys so much. I definitely recommend them.",
        "time": 1769456572,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Dimitra Katsourinis",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100633003187542473796/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWDf8z08eVEFFqtopOSw4iBiRhAi9b4bIrqnAKu8l6jVq7xbeof=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "These guys are on point and on time! They installed an industrial door opener and I was very pleased with their work. They sent me Dominic and he was meticulous and quick. Very happy with the service. Definitely recommend!",
        "time": 1761229089,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "steven niemi",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102089451536800643903/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVviEQ5_iVSx-ED-8ytVclycsVXcbp7b91Hd3l6eVSiz1qy-t4t=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "We live in Eastern Ontario and had them remove our old garage doors and install two new ones. Over the years we have been able to count on them for repairs. They are a busy company so be patient if your situation is not urgent. Roxanne is extremely kind and helpful.",
        "time": 1765639350,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "G. Ayotte",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114683062425663429632/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKhFyn3YI5ZwMsMtHGHuvFbXCFIdfSxaJ0xSkA3zvPICq9nZw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "Chris was quick and efficient to respond to the call and gave all the pertinent information. The installation of the garage door opener was done professionally and quickly.  With no hesitation, I highly recommend Les Industries Andre for their exceptional services. Thank you to the excellent team.",
        "time": 1761495152,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Deirdre McCormack",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106567954946618804252/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLzYJYpAkarSzw1vnMkhXwFh15XHwnRCNl0-eNK1_dYxAIZFg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "9 months ago",
        "text": "I called for help with my 22-year-old garage door opener that they had installed. Chris came over the same day (wow!) to adjust a setting. Then, as he had promised, he returned the next week for another small fix. He was kind and courteous and efficient. I couldn’t have asked for more. Oh, yes, and the price was reasonable!!",
        "time": 1745452237,
        "translated": false
      }
